<title>USA: Eurogas buys OMV (Jakutien) Exploration.</title>
<headline>Eurogas buys OMV (Jakutien) Exploration.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurogas Inc said Thursday it has completed its acquisition of all shares of OMV (Jakutien) Exploration GmbH, formerly a unit of OMV AG.</p>
<p>Eurogas said it paid $6 million in cash plus a 5 percent net profits interest.</p>
<p>The unit's primary asset is a 50 percent interest in the TAKT joint venture with Sakhaneftegaz, the Republic of Yakutia's national oil company.</p>
</text>
